hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"101","Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr bin Muhammad ne mujhe khabar di, Amrah se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jibril sallallahu alaihi wasallam musalsal mujhe parosi ke bare mein wasiyyat karte rahe hatta ke maine gumaan kiya ke woh use waaris bana denge."
"102","Sadaqah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne humein khabar di, Amr se, Nafi bin Jubair se, Abu Shuraih Khuzaai se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne parosi se husn e sulook kare, aur jo shakhs Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki izzat kare, aur jo shakhs Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke bhali baat kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"103","Ahmad bin Humaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fudail ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Saad se, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Zabyah Kalaai se suna, unhon ne kaha: maine Miqdad bin Aswad se suna, woh keh rahe the: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne sahaba se zina ke bare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: haraam hai, Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne use haraam qarar diya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ka das aurton se zina karna us par is se zyada aasaan hai ke woh apne parosi ki biwi se zina kare, aur Aap ne un se chori ke bare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: haraam hai, Allah Azza wa Jal aur Us ke Rasool ne use haraam qarar diya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Das ghar walon se chori karna us par is se zyada aasaan hai ke woh apne parosi ke ghar se chori kare."
"104","Muhammad bin Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Zurai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jibril musalsal mujhe parosi ke bare mein wasiyyat karte rahe hatta ke maine gumaan kiya ke woh use waaris bana denge."
"105","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyaynah ne humein khabar di, Dawood bin Shaboor aur Abu Ismail se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin Amr se, ke un ke liye ek bakri zibah ki gayi, to woh apne ghulam se kehte rahe: kya tum ne hamare Yahoodi parosi ko tohfa diya, kya tum ne hamare Yahoodi parosi ko tohfa diya, maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: Jibril musalsal mujhe parosi ke bare mein wasiyyat karte rahe hatta ke maine gumaan kiya ke woh use waaris bana denge."
"106","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Yahya bin Saeed se suna, woh kehte the: Abu Bakr ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Amrah ne un se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se suna, woh farmati thin: maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: Jibril musalsal mujhe parosi ke bare mein wasiyyat karte rahe hatta ke maine gumaan kiya ke woh zaroor use waaris bana denge."
"107","Hajjaj bin Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Imran ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Talha se suna, Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, mere do parosi hain, to main un mein se kis ko tohfa dun, Aap ne farmaya: Un mein se jo darwaze ke aitbaar se tum se zyada qareeb ho."
"108","Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Imran Jauni se, Talha bin Abdullah se, jo Bani Taim bin Murrah mein se ek shakhs hain, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, mere do parosi hain, to main un mein se kis ko tohfa dun, Aap ne farmaya: Un mein se jo darwaze ke aitbaar se tum se zyada qareeb ho."
"109","Husain bin Huraith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazl bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Waleed bin Dinar se, Hasan se, ke un se parosi ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Us ke saamne chaalees ghar, us ke peeche chaalees, us ke daayein chaalees aur us ke baayein chaalees."
"110","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah bin Ammar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah bin Bajalah bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Hurairah se suna, unhon ne kaha: Woh apne door ke parosi se qareeb wale parosi se pehle ibtida na kare, lekin qareeb wale se door wale se pehle ibtida kare."
"111","Malik bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdussalam ne hum se bayan kiya, Laith se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Hum par ek zamana aaya, ya unhon ne kaha: ek waqt, aur koi shakhs apne deenaar aur dirham ka apne Musalman bhai se zyada haqdaar na tha, phir ab deenaar aur dirham hum mein se har ek ko apne Musalman bhai se zyada mehboob hai, maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: Qayamat ke din kitne hi parosi apne parosi se chimte honge jo kahega: Ya Rabb, is ne mujh par apna darwaza band kar liya, pas us ne apna ehsaan mujh se rok liya."
"112","Muhammad bin Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Abi Bashir se, Abdullah bin Musawir se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas se suna, woh Ibn Zubair ko khabar de rahe the, woh kehte the: maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: Woh momin nahi jo khud pair bhar kar khaye aur us ka parosi bhooka ho."
"113","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hamein khabar di, Abu Imran Jauni se, Abdullah bin Samit se, Hazrat Abu Zarr se, unhon ne farmaya: Mere Khaleel sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe teen baaton ki waseeyat farmayi: main sunoon aur itaat karoon agarche katay hue aaza wale ghulam ke liye ho, aur jab tum shorba pakao to uska pani zyada karo, phir apne hamsayon mein se kisi ghar walon ko dekho to unhein us mein se bhalayi ke saath pohunchao, aur namaz uske waqt par parho, phir agar tum imam ko pao ke woh namaz parh chuka hai to tum ne apni namaz mehfooz kar li, warna woh nafl hai."
"114","Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Abdus Samad Ammi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Imran ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Samit se, Hazrat Abu Zarr se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr, jab tum shorba pakao to shorbe ka pani zyada karo, aur apne hamsayon ki khabar lo ya apne hamsayon mein taqseem karo."
"115","Abdullah bin Yazeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haiwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shurahbeel bin Shareek ne hamein khabar di, ke unhon ne Abu Abdur Rahman Hubuli ko bayan karte hue suna, Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Taala ke nazdeek behtareen dost woh hai jo apne dost ke liye behtareen ho, aur Allah Taala ke nazdeek behtareen hamsaya woh hai jo apne hamsaye ke liye behtareen ho."
"116","Muhammad bin Kaseer ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Khumail ne mujh se bayan kiya, Nafe bin Abdul Haris se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ki saadat mein se hai kushada makan, aur nek hamsaya, aur pur sukoon sawari."
"117","Sadaqa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman jo Ibn Hayyan hain ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Ajlan se, Saeed se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki dua mein se tha: Ae Allah be shak main Teri panah chahta hoon mustaqil rehne ke ghar mein bure hamsaye se, kyunke duniya ka hamsaya badal jata hai."
"118","Makhlad bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Maghra ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Buraid bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Burda se, Hazrat Abu Musa se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qayam na hogi yahan tak ke aadmi apne hamsaye aur apne bhai aur apne baap ko qatal kare."
"119","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yahya maula Jada bin Hubaira ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, falan aurat raat ko qiyam karti hai aur din ko roza rakhti hai, aur aise aise karti hai, aur sadqa karti hai, aur apne hamsayon ko apni zuban se aza deti hai? To Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Us mein koi bhalayi nahi, woh dozakh walon mein se hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur falan aurat farz namaz parhti hai, aur athwaar se sadqa karti hai, aur kisi ko aza nahi deti? To Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Woh jannat walon mein se hai."
"120","Abdullah bin Yazeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umara bin Gurab ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke unki ek phuphi ne un se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Hazrat Ayesha Ummul Momineen raziyallahu anha se sawal kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se kisi ka shohar usko chahta hai to woh usko apne nafs se rokti hai, ya woh ghusse mein hoti hai ya chust nahi hoti, to kya hum par is mein koi harj hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, be shak uska haq tum par ye hai ke agar woh tumhein chahe aur tum oont ke kajawe par bhi ho to usko na roko, unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha: Hum mein se koi haiz se hoti hai, aur uske aur uske shohar ke liye ek hi bichone ya ek hi lihaaf ke siwa kuch nahi hota, to woh kya kare? Unhon ne kaha: Use chahiye ke woh apne upar tehband baandh le phir uske saath soye, phir uske liye us se upar ka hissa hai, iske saath main tumhein zaroor bataungi ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kya kiya: Woh meri raat Aap ki thi, to main ne kuch jau peesa, phir Aap ke liye uski ek roti banayi, to Aap dakhil hue aur darwaza band kar diya, aur masjid mein dakhil hue, aur Aap jab sona chahte to darwaza band kar dete, aur mashkeeze ka munh baandh dete, aur pyale ko aundha kar dete, aur chiragh bujha dete, to main Aap ka intezar karti rahi ke Aap wapas aayein to main Aap ko roti khilaoon, to Aap wapas na aaye yahan tak ke neend mujh par ghalib aa gayi, aur sardi ne Aap ko takleef di, to Aap mere paas aaye aur mujhe uthaya phir farmaya: Mujhe garm karo mujhe garm karo, to main ne Aap se kaha: Main haiza hoon, to Aap ne farmaya: Agarche ho, apni raanon se kapra hatao, to main ne Aap ke liye apni raanon se kapra hataya, to Aap ne apna rukhsar aur sar meri raanon par rakh diya yahan tak ke garm ho gaye, phir hamare hamsaye ki paaltu bakri aayi aur dakhil hui, phir us ne roti ka qasd kiya aur usko le liya, phir usko le kar peeth pher kar chali gayi, unhon ne kaha: Aur main Aap se alag hokar ghabra gayi, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bedaar hue to main uski taraf darwaze ki taraf daudi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Apni roti mein se jo pao le lo, aur apne hamsaye ko uski bakri ke baare mein aza na do."
"121","Sulaiman bin Dawood Abu Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ala bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil na hoga woh jis ke hamsaye ko uski shararton se aman na ho."
"122","Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Amr bin Muaz Ashhali se, unki dadi se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ae momin auraton, tum mein se koi aurat apni hamsayan ko haqeer na samjhe agarche bakri ka jala hua khur hi ho."
"123","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed Maqburi ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Musalman auraton, ae Musalman auraton, koi hamsayan apni hamsayan ko haqeer na samjhe agarche bakri ka khur hi ho."
"124","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ajlan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mera ek hamsaya hai jo mujhe aza deta hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur apna saman raste par nikal do, to woh gaya aur apna saman nikal diya, to log us par jama ho gaye, to unhon ne kaha: Tumhara kya haal hai? Us ne kaha: Mera ek hamsaya hai jo mujhe aza deta hai, to main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur apna saman raste par nikal do, to woh kehne lage: Ae Allah us par lanat kar, Ae Allah usko ruswa kar, to usko khabar pohunchi, to woh uske paas aaya aur kaha: Apne ghar wapas aao, Allah ki qasam main tumhein kabhi aza na dunga."
"125","Ali bin Hakeem Al-Audi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Umar se, Abu Juhayfa se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se apne padosi ki shikayat ki to Aap ne farmaya: apna saman uthao aur use raste par rakh do to jo us ke paas se guzrega use laanat karega, phir har shakhs jo us ke paas se guzarta use laanat karne laga, phir woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: logon ki taraf se mujhe kya kuch sahna pada hai to Aap ne farmaya: beshak Allah ki laanat un ki laanat se upar hai, phir Aap ne us shakhs se jis ne shikayat ki thi farmaya: tumhari kifayat kar di gayi ya isi tarah ki baat farmayi."
"126","Makhlad bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zuhair Abdur Rahman bin Maghra ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazl yani Ibn Mubashshir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas apne padosi ke khilaf madad talab karne aaya, phir jabke woh Rukn aur Maqam ke darmiyan baitha hua tha ke achanak Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye aur us shakhs ne Aap ko dekha jabke Aap Maqam ke paas jahan janazon par namaz parhi jati hai safed kapde pehne hue ek shakhs ke muqabil khade baat kar rahe the, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mutawajjeh hue to us ne kaha: mere maan baap Aap par qurban hon Ya Rasulullah, woh kaun shakhs tha jise main ne Aap ke sath dekha jo Aap ke muqabil khada tha us par safed kapde the, Aap ne farmaya: kya tum ne use waqai dekha tha, us ne kaha: ji han, Aap ne farmaya: tum ne bahut zyada bhalai dekhi, woh Jibreel sallallahu alaihi wasallam hain jo mere Rabb ke rasool hain, woh barabar mujhe padosi ke bare mein wasiyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kiya ke woh us ke liye meeras muqarrar kar denge."
"127","Isam bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Artaat bin Al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne yani Abu Amir Al-Himsi se suna, unhon ne kaha: Sauban kehte the: koi do shakhs aise nahin jo teen din se zyada qata talluq karte hain phir un mein se ek halak ho jata hai phir dono isi qata talluq ki halat par marte hain magar woh dono hi halak hote hain, aur koi padosi aisa nahin jo apne padosi par zulm karta hai aur use dabata hai yahan tak ke woh zulm use apne ghar se nikalne par majboor kar deta hai magar woh halak ho jata hai."
"128","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Basheer bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: main Abdullah bin Amr ke paas tha aur un ka ghulam bakri ki khaal utar raha tha to unhon ne kaha: aye ghulam jab tum farigh ho jao to hamare Yahudi padosi se shuru karna to majlis mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Yahudi ko Allah aap ki islah kare, unhon ne kaha: beshak main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko padosi ke bare mein wasiyat farmate hue suna yahan tak ke humein andesha hua ya hum ne samjha ke woh use waaris bana denge."
